icle safety by delivering reliable and consistent braking response. 2. Durable Construction Constructed from high-quality materials, the RCB E2 Series Master Brake Pump offers exceptional durability and longevity. This robust design withstands the rigors of daily use and harsh conditions, ensuring that it remains a dependable component in any braking system. Users can trust in its ability to perform under pressure, enhancing overall vehicle reliability. 3. Enhanced Performance This master brake pump is engineered to improve braking performance significantly. With its advanced design, it facilitates smoother pedal feel and quicker response times, allowing for greater control during driving. The RCB E2 Series is ideal for those looking to upgrade their braking system for better handling and safety on the road. 4. Easy Installation The RCB E2 Series Master Brake Pump is designed for straightforward installation, minimizing downtime and ensuring that vehicles can be back on the road quickly. Its compatibility with various braking systems simplifies the replacement process, making it an excellent choice for mechanics and enthusiasts alike who value efficiency and convenience. 5. Trusted Brand Quality Backed by the reputable RCB brand, the E2 Series Master Brake Pump embodies quality and reliability. RCB is known for its commitment to excellence in automotive components, and this product is no exception. Users can have confidence in their purchase, knowing they are investing in a high-performance product from a trusted manufacturer in the industry.\",\"sku\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52880865165629\",\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Primo Customs\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"3989.0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"url\":\"https://iranimotohub.in/products/rcb-e2-series-master-brake-pump-lh-14mm-01bp004b\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\"