border-x border-brand-border\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-5 h-5 text-brand-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Certified Product</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-credit-card w-5 h-5 text-brand-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"5\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"22\" y1=\"10\" y2=\"10\"></line></svg><span>Secure Payments</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-2 bg-white border border-brand-border p-6 md:p-8 rounded-xl space-y-8 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><h3 class=\"font-headings font-extrabold text-lg tracking-wider text-brand-primary uppercase pb-2 border-b border-brand-border\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h3><div class=\"relative font-body\"><p class=\"text-brand-muted text-sm leading-relaxed line-clamp-3\">FEATURES Made of high quality aluminium alloy Improves stopping power performance Hard-anodized surface to increase corrosion resistance and surface hardness Transparent reservoir tank 1. Precision Engineering The RCB E2 Series Master Brake Pump is designed with precision engineering to ensure optimal performance in braking systems. Its 14mm bore size provides the ideal balance of power and control, making it suitable for a range of applications. This master brake pump enhances vehicle safety by delivering reliable and consistent braking response. 2. Durable Construction Constructed from high-quality materials, the RCB E2 Series Master Brake Pump offers exceptional durability and longevity. This robust design withstands the rigors of daily use and harsh conditions, ensuring that it remains a dependable component in any braking system. Users can trust in its ability to perform under pressure, enhancing overall vehicle reliability. 3. Enhanced Performance This master brake pump is engineered to improve braking performance significantly. With its advanced design, it facilitates smoother pedal feel and quicker response times, allowing for greater control during driving. The RCB E2 Series is ideal for those looking to upgrade their braking system for better handling and safety on the road. 4. Easy Installation The RCB E2 Series Master Brake Pump is designed for straightforward installation, minimizing downtime and ensuring that vehicles can be back on the road quickly. Its compatibility with various braking systems simplifies the replacement process, making it an excellent choice for mechanics and enthusiasts alike who value efficiency and convenience. 5. Trusted Brand Quality Backed by the reputable RCB brand, the E2 Series Master Brake Pump embodies quality and reliability. RCB is known for its commitment to excellence in automotive components, and this product is no exception. Users can have confidence in their purchase, knowing they are investing in a high-performance product from a trusted manufacturer in the industry.</p><button class=\"mt-2 text-brand-red hover:text-brand-primary text-xs font-bold flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors focus:outline-none cursor-pointer\">Show More <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-24 pt-16 border-t border-brand-border\"><div class=\"mb-12\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest text-brand-red uppercase block mb-1\">Matching Upgrades</span><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-headings font-extrabold tracking-tight text-brand-primary uppercase\">RELATED PERFORMANCE PARTS</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"group bg-white border border-brand-border p-4 rounded-lg hover:shadow-lg hover:border-brand-primary transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col relative \"><div class=\"relative aspect-square w-full bg-brand-bg overflow-hidden rounded mb-4 border border-brand-border\"><a href=\"/products/66bhp-venta-320mm-floating-brake-disc-for-interceptor-650-gt-650\"><img alt=\"Interceptor 650 &amp; GT 650 Floating Brake Disc\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain p-4 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"200px\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/GT_650_rotor_b8b73c74-a007-41b1-bc31-93456c67875a.png?v=1787064834&amp;width=32 32w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/GT_650_rotor_b8b73c74-a007-41b1-bc31-93456c67875a.png?v=1787064834&amp;width=48 48w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/GT_650_rotor_b8b73c74-a007-41b1-bc31-93456c67875a.png?v=1787064834&amp;width=64 64w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/GT_650_rotor_b8b73c74-a007-41b1-bc31-93456c67875a.png?v=1787064834&amp;width=96 96w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/GT_650_rotor_b8b73c74-a007-41b1-bc31-93456c67875a.png?v=1787064834&amp;width=128 128w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/GT_650_rotor_b8b73c74-a007-41b1-bc31-93456c67875a.png?v=1787064834&amp;width=256 256w, https://cdn.s