 designed with precision engineering to ensure optimal performance in braking systems. Its 14mm bore size provides the ideal balance of power and control, making it suitable for a range of applications. This master brake pump enhances vehicle safety by delivering reliable and consistent braking response. 2. Durable Construction Constructed from high-quality materials, the RCB E2 Series Master Brake Pump offers exceptional durability and longevity. This robust design withstands the rigors of daily use and harsh conditions, ensuring that it remains a dependable component in any braking system. Users can trust in its ability to perform under pressure, enhancing overall vehicle reliability. 3. Enhanced Performance This master brake pump is engineered to improve braking performance significantly. With its advanced design, it facilitates smoother pedal feel and quicker response times, allowing for greater control during driving. The RCB E2 Series is ideal for those looking to upgrade their braking system for better handling and safety on the road. 4. Easy Installation The RCB E2 Series Master Brake Pump is designed for straightforward installation, minimizing downtime and ensuring that vehicles can be back on the road quickly. Its compatibility with various braking systems simplifies the replacement process, making it an excellent choice for mechanics and enthusiasts alike who value efficiency and convenience. 5. Trusted Brand Quality Backed by the reputable RCB brand, the E2 Series Master Brake Pump embodies quality and reliability. RCB is known for its commitment to excellence in automotive components, and this product is no exception. Users can have confidence in their purchase, knowing they are investing in a high-performance product from a trusted manufacturer in the industry.46:T94c,Upgrade Your Braking Confidence Built for riders who demand stronger braking performance, the 66BHP Venta 320mm Floating Brake Disc is engineered to deliver superior stopping power, improved heat dissipation, and consistent braking under aggressive riding conditions. Designed specifically for the Royal Enfield Interceptor 650 and Continental GT 650, the Venta Floating Disc combines a lightweight CNC-machined aluminium carrier with a high-grade stainless steel braking surface for exceptional performance on both the street and spirited weekend rides. Key Highlights ✅ 320mm Performance Rotor Larger braking surface provides improved braking leverage for stronger and more controlled stopping power. ✅ Lightweight Aluminium Inner Carrier Precision-machined aluminium centre reduces unsprung weight while maintaining excellent rigidity. ✅ Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor High-quality stainless steel braking surface offers excellent durability, consistent friction, and long service life. ✅ Floating Rotor Design Allows controlled movement between the carrier and rotor, helping reduce brake judder while maintaining optimal pad contact. ✅ Performance Ventilation Specially designed ventilation pattern improves airflow and heat dissipation, helping maintain braking performance even during repeated hard braking. ✅ Superior Stopping Power Engineered to provide improved brake feel, greater modulation, and increased rider confidence. Features 320mm Performance Floating Brake Disc CNC Machined Aluminium Inner Carrier Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor Performance Ventilation Design Floating Construction for Consistent Braking Excellent Heat Dissipation Improved Brake Feel & Modulation Direct Fit Installation Corrosion Resistant Finish Precision Manufactured Vehicle Compatibility Royal Enfield Interceptor 650 Royal Enfield Continental GT 650 What's Included 1 × 66BHP Venta 320mm Floating Front Brake Disc Why Choose 66BHP Venta? Every 66BHP Venta Floating Disc is designed for riders who expect confidence under braking. Whether you're riding through city traffic, carving mountain roads, or touring long distances, the advanced floating construction and performance ventilation help deliver smoother braking, reduced heat build-up, and dependable stopping performance when you need it most. Ride with confidence. Brake with precision. Ride with 66BHP.47:Ta9a,Upgrade Your Braking Confidence Experience sharper braking performance with the 66BHP Venta 282mm Floating Brake Disc, precision-engineered for the Yamaha R15 V4. Designed as a direct OEM replacement, this premium floating rotor installs without any modifications, making it the perfect upgrade for riders seeking improved braking feel, better heat management, and superior stopping power. Constructed with a lightweight CNC-machined aluminium carrier and a premium stainless steel braking surface, the Venta Floating Disc is built to deliver consistent braking performance whether you're commuting, touring, or enjoying spirited rides. Key Highlights ✅ Direct Fit for Yamaha R15 V4 Designed to match OEM specifications for a hassle-free installation. No drilling, spacers, or alterations required. ✅ 282mm Performance Rotor Optimized rotor size provides stronger braking performance with excellent control and rider feedback. ✅ Lightweight Aluminium Inner Carrier Precision CNC-machined aluminium centre helps reduce unsprung weight while maintaining exceptional strength and durability. ✅ Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor High-grade stainless steel braking surface ensures excellent wear resistance, consistent braking, and long service life. ✅ Floating Rotor Design Floating construction allows controlled movement between the carrier and rotor, improving pad contact while helping reduce brake judder. ✅ Performance Ventilation Performance-oriented ventilation pattern enhances airflow and heat dissipation, maintaining braking efficiency during repeated hard braking. ✅ Superior Stopping Power Delivers enhanced braking confidence, improved modulation, and dependable performance across all riding conditions. Features 282mm Performance Floating Brake Disc Direct OEM Replacement No Alterations Required CNC Machined Aluminium Inner Carrier Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor Floating Construction for Consistent Braking Performance Ventilation Design Improved Heat Dissipation Enhanced Brake Feel & Modulation Corrosion Resistant Finish Precision Manufactured Vehicle Compatibility Yamaha R15 V4 What's Included 1 × 66BHP Venta 282mm Floating Front Brake Disc Why Choose 66BHP Venta? Engineered for riders who demand confidence under braking, the 66BHP Venta Floating Brake Disc combines lightweight construction, advanced floating technology, and a performance ventilation design to deliver consistent braking performance, reduced heat build-up, and superior stopping power. Whether you're riding through city traffic or pushing your bike on open roads, Venta is built to inspire confidence every time you brake. Precision Engineered. Direct Fit. Superior Stopping Power. Ride with 66BHP.48:Tc7c,Upgrade Your Braking Confidence Experience exceptional braking performance with the 66BHP Venta 320mm Front Floating Brake Disc, engineered specifically for the KTM Duke 390 (2017–2023). Designed for riders who demand precision, reliability, and maximum stopping power, this premium floating rotor delivers improved heat dissipation, sharper brake response, and consistent braking performance in every riding condition. Built with a lightweight CNC-machined aluminium carrier and a premium stainless steel braking surface, the Venta Floating Disc is a direct OEM replacement, ensuring an easy installation using the factory mounting points with no modifications or alterations required. Key Highlights ✅ Direct Fit for KTM Duke 390 (2017–2023) Designed to OEM specifications for perfect fitment. No drilling, spacers, or modifications required. ✅ 320mm Performance Rotor Large diameter rotor provides increased braking leverage for stronger, smoother, and more progressive braking performance. ✅ Lightweight Aluminium Inner Carrier Precision CNC-machined aluminium carrier reduces unsprung weight while maintaining exceptional strength and rigidity. ✅ Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor Manufactured from high-grade stainless steel for excellent wear resistance, reliable braking performance, and extended service life. ✅ Floating Rotor Design Floating construction allows controlled movement between the carrier and braking surface, maintaining optimal pad contact while helping reduce brake judder. ✅ Performance Ventilation Performance-oriented ventilation pattern improves airflow and heat dissipation, ensuring fade-resistant braking even during repeated hard braking. ✅ Superior Stopping Power Provides enhanced brake feel, improved modulation, and dependable stopping performance for daily commuting, highway riding, and spirited cornering. Features 320mm Performance Floating Brake Disc Direct OEM Replacement No Alterations Required CNC Machined Aluminium Inner Carrier Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor Floating Construction for Consistent Braking Performance Ventilation Design Improved Heat Dissipation Enhanced Brake Feel & Modulation Corrosion Resistant Finish Precision Manufactured Vehicle Compatibility KTM Duke 390 (2017–2023) OE Cross Reference Compatible as a replacement for the following OEM reference numbers: JP131817 JF131876 These OE reference numbers are provided for fitment verification purposes only. What's Included 1 × 66BHP Venta 320mm Front Floating Brake Disc Why Choose 66BHP Venta? The 66BHP Venta Floating Brake Disc is engineered for riders who demand premium braking performance and complete confidence on every ride. Featuring a lightweight aluminium carrier, premium stainless steel braking surface, advanced floating technology, and a performance ventilation design, it delivers exceptional stopping power, reduced heat build-up, and consistent braking performance under all riding conditions. Whether you're commuting, touring, or pushing your KTM on winding roads, the Venta Floating Brake Disc is built to provide the control and confidence you need. Precision Engineered. Direct Fit. Superior Stopping Power. Ride with 66BHP.49:Tc37,Upgrade Your Braking Confidence Enhance the braking performance of your KTM Duke 250 (2017–2023) with the 66BHP Venta 320mm Front Floating Brake Disc. Designed for riders who demand precision, reliability, and superior stopping power, this premium floating rotor offers improved heat dissipation, excellent brake feel, and consistent braking performance in every riding condition. Manufactured using a lightweight CNC-machined aluminium carrier and a premium stainless steel braking surface, the Venta Floating Disc is engineered as a direct OEM replacement, ensuring a perfect installation with no modifications or alterations required. Key Highlights ✅ Direct Fit for KTM Duke 250 (2017–2023) Engineered to OEM specifications for a perfect fit using the factory mounting points. No drilling, spacers, or modifications required. ✅ 320mm Performance Rotor Large diameter rotor provides increased braking leverage for stronger, smoother, and more progressive braking performance. ✅ Lightweight Aluminium Inner Carrier Precision CNC-machined aluminium carrier helps reduce unsprung weight while maintaining exceptional structural strength. ✅ Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor High-grade stainless steel braking surface offers excellent wear resistance, reliable braking performance, and extended service life. ✅ Floating Rotor Design Advanced floating construction allows controlled movement between the carrier and rotor, maintaining optimal pad contact while helping reduce brake judder. ✅ Performance Ventilation Performance-oriented ventilation pattern improves airflow and heat dissipation, maintaining braking efficiency even during repeated hard braking. ✅ Superior Stopping Power Delivers improved brake feel, enhanced modulation, and dependable braking performance for city riding, highway touring, and spirited cornering. Features 320mm Performance Floating Brake Disc Direct OEM Replacement No Alterations Required CNC Machined Aluminium Inner Carrier Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor Floating Construction for Consistent Braking Performance Ventilation Design Improved Heat Dissipation Enhanced Brake Feel & Modulation Corrosion Resistant Finish Precision Manufactured Vehicle Compatibility KTM Duke 250 (2017–2023) OE Cross Reference Compatible as a replacement for the following OEM reference numbers: JP131818 JF131876 These OE reference numbers are provided for fitment verification purposes only. What's Included 1 × 66BHP Venta 320mm Front Floating Brake Disc Why Choose 66BHP Venta? The 66BHP Venta Floating Brake Disc is developed for riders who expect premium braking performance without compromise. Combining a lightweight aluminium carrier, premium stainless steel braking surface, advanced floating technology, and a performance ventilation design, it delivers powerful braking, reduced heat build-up, and consistent performance ride after ride. Whether you're commuting, touring, or enjoying aggressive weekend rides, the Venta Floating Brake Disc provides the confidence and control your KTM deserves. Precision Engineered. Direct Fit. Superior Stopping Power. Ride with 66BHP.42:[\"$\",\"$L44\",null,{\"product\":{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Product/10473506799933\",\"handle\":\"rcb-e2-series-master-brake-pump-lh-14mm-01bp004b\",\"title\":\"RCB E2 SERIES MASTER BRAKE PUMP LH 14MM 01BP004B\",\"description\":\"$45\",\"priceRange\":{\"minVariantPrice\":{\"amount\":\"3989.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"}},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/11_d3a486e1-3d04-40d8-ad7b-b1bf6c78b7d4.jpg?v=1787152749\",\"altText\":\"RCB E2 SERIES MASTER BRAKE PUMP LH 14MM 01BP004B\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/33_e6ff5834-3f1b-4694-964a-52f983de5763.jpg?v=1787152749\",\"altText\":\"RCB E2 SERIES MASTER BRAKE PUMP LH 14MM 01BP004B\"}],\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52880865165629\",\"title\":\"Default Title\"